606
00:38:36,620 --> 00:38:38,221
Está bien.
Sigue hablando.

607
00:38:38,255 --> 00:38:39,856
Protesta.

608
00:38:39,890 --> 00:38:41,023
Lucha.

609
00:38:42,793 --> 00:38:43,826
Marie, déjalo.

610
00:38:43,861 --> 00:38:46,529
De verdad te lo digo,

611
00:38:46,563 --> 00:38:48,865
